      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Nuclear deterrence is the ultimate guarantor of global stability, a grim but necessary evil that prevents the catastrophic wars of the past. The threat of mutual assured destruction forces great powers into dialogue and restraint, ensuring that no single nation can achieve unchecked hegemony. Without this ultimate deterrent, the world would descend into a chaotic, nuclear-free arms race that is far more dangerous.\n\nFor the opposition, the argument against nuclear weapons is simply that they are inherently immoral weapons of mass destruction. This weak stance fails to acknowledge the brutal reality that the alternative to nuclear deterrence is uncontrolled, conventional warfare leading to far greater human suffering.",
      "source": "target",
